  "title": "Coast Guard rescues 2 people stranded on rock near Trinidad State Beach",
  "description": "An MH-65 Dolphin Helicopter crew from Coast Guard Air Station Humboldt Bay completes two hoists for a pair of young men atop a large rock at Trinidad State Beach, California, Nov. 22, 2026. Coast Guard watchstanders received the call from California State Parks about the two men and diverted the Dolphin aircrew to conduct the medevac; both were reported transferred to local emergency medical services for further care. (U.S. Coast Guard photo)",
